{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12701","headline":"石鱼湖上作 · 元结","name":"石鱼湖上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱石鱼湖，石鱼在湖里。\n鱼背有酒樽，绕鱼是湖水。\n儿童坐小舫，载酒胜一桮。\n座中令酒舫，空去复满来。\n湖岸多欹石，石下流寒泉。\n醉中一盥漱，快意无比焉。\n金玉吾不须，轩冕吾不爱。\n且欲坐湖畔，石鱼长相对。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}